OL,3,AZelensky condemns 'vile' large-scale
OL,4,ARussian attacks that killed 15
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 15 people have died in
OL,7,Fovernight strikes across central and
OL,8,Feastern Ukraine, in what Volodymyr
OL,9,FZelensky has described as one of
OL,10,FRussia's "most vile" attacks.
OL,12,FUkraine's president said a residential
OL,13,Fbuilding in Pryluky in the Chernihiv
OL,14,Fregion was destroyed as a "birthday
OL,15,F'gift' to Putin", who turns 74 on
OL,16,FWednesday. Strikes also hit Kyiv,
OL,17,FDnipro, Kremenchuk, Zaporizhzhia and
OL,18,FOleksandriya.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
