OL,3,AZelensky condemns 'vile' large-scale
OL,4,ARussian attacks that killed 15
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky said Ukraine had struck
OL,7,Ftargets in attacks on Russia's Perm,
OL,8,FSamara and Astrakhan regions in the
OL,9,Fpast 24 hours, adding there was "also a
OL,10,Fresponse in the Black Sea", without
OL,11,Fproviding further details.
OL,13,FMoscow is yet to comment on the latest
OL,14,Fstrikes.
